<WebComment>This site is located at Waihenga Bridge, about 2kms out of Martinborough. It is the most downstream flow monitoring site on the Ruamahanga River. The site has been operating since 1956. Note that during large floods some of the flood flow is diverted through the floodway. An estimate of the total flow is available using the &quot;Total Flow&quot; measurement.</WebComment>
